  ('communication-6', 'communication', 'lesson', 2, 3, 'Why can forwarding a long email thread be risky?', '["It may reveal earlier private messages","It deletes the attachments","It slows the internet","It changes the subject"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Threads often include earlier content others should not see.'),
